---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="GTA Weekly Bonuses | 2 Smokin' Barrels"
        description="Halloween arrives in Los Santos! Earn 3X rewards on Halloween Survivals and Slasher modes, claim a GTA$500,000 bonus from Security Contracts, and save 40% on Agency properties and spooky vehicles."
        image="https://2smokinbarrels.com/images/gta-bonuses-banner.jpg"
    >
    <main class="container">
       
        <header style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
            <h1 class="page-title">GTA Weekly Report</h1>
            <p class="date-range" style="text-align: center; color: var(--white-med); text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 1px;">October 1, 2026 — October 7, 2026</p>
            
        <!-- Modernized Highlight Box -->
        <div style="background: rgba(38, 30, 62, 0.4); 
                    border-left: 5px solid var(--accent-pink); 
                    padding: 25px; 
                    margin-top: 20px; 
                    text-align: left; 
                    border-radius: 12px; 
                    backdrop-filter: blur(10px); 
                    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);">
                <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--white-low);">
                    A new GTA Online event starts on October 1 (available through October 7). Brace yourself for a terrifying <span style="color: var(--accent-orange); font-weight: 700;">Halloween in Los Santos</span> with Slashers, paranormal sightings, returning Survivals and Featured Series, spooky rewards, discounted vehicles, and <span style="color: var(--accent-pink); font-weight: 700;">GTA$500,000</span> for completing five Security Contracts.
                </p>
            </div>
        </header>

        <!-- WEEKLY BONUSES GRID -->
        <div class="bonus-grid">
            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Event Highlights & Challenges</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Weekly Challenge:</strong> Secure two Bail Office Bounties to get the Green Vintage Skull Mask and GTA$100,000</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Security Contract Bonus:</strong> Complete five Security Contracts through October 7 to receive GTA$500,000 (within 72 hours)</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Halloween Challenge:</strong> Complete all Weekly Challenges through November 4 to receive GTA$2,000,000 (within 72 hours)</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Free Clothing:</strong> Claim the Cheerleader Massacre 3 T-Shirt for free at in-game clothing stores</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Returning Halloween Events:</strong> Slashers, Clone Slasher, Phantom Car, Cerberus Surprise, Possessed Animals, Ghosts Exposed, Jack O'Lanterns, Peyote Plants, plus Halloween Masks, Face Paints, Horns, Bobbleheads & Casino Decorations</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Bonus GTA$ & RP</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><span class="multiplier">3X</span> <strong>GTA$ & RP:</strong> Halloween Featured Series (Slasher, Ramius - Slasher) & Halloween Survivals (Ludendorff Cemetery, Cayo Perico & Alien Survivals)</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><span class="multiplier">3X</span> <strong>GTA$ & RP:</strong> San Andreas Super Sport Series (Hotring Races, Random Transform Races) & Community Race Series</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><span class="multiplier">2X</span> <strong>GTA$ & RP:</strong> Bail Office Standard & Most Wanted Targets, Dispatch Work, UFO Business Battles, and Jack O' Lanterns</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><span class="multiplier">2X</span> <strong>GTA$:</strong> Ghosts Exposed</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Discounts & Gun Van</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>40% OFF:</strong> Agency Properties (including Upgrades & Modifications), Albany Brigham, Albany Fränken Stange, Albany Lurcher, Declasse Tornado Rat Rod, and LCC Sanctus</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>30% OFF Vehicles:</strong> Benefactor Schlagen GT, Declasse Vigero ZX, Grotti Brioso 300, Lampadati Komoda, Nagasaki Buzzard Attack Chopper, Nagasaki Ultralight, Ocelot Ardent, Sea Sparrow, and Western Powersurge</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Gun Van (FREE):</strong> Baseball Bat & The Shocker</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Gun Van (30% OFF):</strong> Service Carbine</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Gun Van (50% OFF GTA+):</strong> Up-n-Atomizer, Unholy Hellbringer & Widowmaker</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Gun Van (Standard):</strong> Precision Rifle, Combat Shotgun, El Strickler, Knife & Pipe Bombs</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Free Vehicles & Showrooms</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Lucky Wheel:</strong> Lampadati Cinquemila</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>LS Car Meet Prize Ride:</strong> Vapid Dominator GTT (Place Top 5 in the LS Car Meet Series for three days in a row)</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Premium Deluxe Motorsport:</strong> Albany Brigham, Albany Fränken Stange, Albany Lurcher, Declasse Tornado Rat Rod & LCC Sanctus</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Luxury Autos:</strong> Dewbauchee Rapid GT X & Übermacht Sentinel XS4</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Test Rides & Trials</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Test Track:</strong> Ocelot Locust, Dewbauchee Seven-70 & Declasse Vamos</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Premium Test Ride (HSW):</strong> Maibatsu MonstroCiti</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Premium Race:</strong> Arms Race</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Time Trials:</strong> Maze Bank Arena (Standard) & Ron Alternates to Elysian Island (HSW)</div>
            </div>
             
            <div class="bonus-card">
                 <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Heists & Robberies</h3>
                 <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Kortz Center Primary Targets:</strong> Chat on Fruit, Juiced & The Downfall of Rome</div>
                 <div class="bonus-item"><strong>FIB Priority File:</strong> The Project Breakaway File</div>
                 <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Salvage Yard (Top Tier):</strong> The Cargo Ship Robbery - Bravado Buffalo EVX</div>
                 <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Salvage Yard (Standard Tier):</strong> The McTony Robbery - Karin Everon</div>
                 <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Salvage Yard (Standard Tier):</strong> The Duggan Robbery - Albany Fränken Stange</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- HALLOWEEN MONTH-LONG UNLOCKS SECTION -->
        <div style="background: rgba(38, 30, 62, 0.4); padding: 40px; margin-top: 4rem; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); text-align: left;">
            <h2 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 3rem; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4); margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center;">Halloween Month-Long Unlocks & Challenges</h2>
            
            <p style="color: var(--white-med); font-size: 1.1rem; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 15px;">
                Playing GTA Online throughout October treats you to free apparel and accessories, while completing increasingly difficult Weekly Challenges earns you spooky gifts and cash rewards.
            </p>
            <p style="color: var(--white-low); font-size: 1.1rem; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
                <strong style="color: var(--accent-pink);">Grand Prize Bonus:</strong> Complete all five Weekly Challenges throughout the month to earn an extra <strong>GTA$2,000,000 bonus</strong> (delivered within 72 hours of completion).
            </p>

            <h3 style="color: var(--accent-pink); font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 10px;">Week 1: October 1 – 7</h3>
            <ul style="color: var(--white-low); font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 25px; padding-left: 20px;">
                <li><strong>Login Unlock:</strong> Cheerleader Massacre 3 T-Shirt</li>
                <li><strong>Weekly Challenge:</strong> Secure two Bail Office Bounties to get the Green Vintage Skull Mask and GTA$100,000</li>
            </ul>

            <h3 style="color: var(--accent-pink); font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 10px;">Week 2: October 8 – 14</h3>
            <ul style="color: var(--white-low); font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 25px; padding-left: 20px;">
                <li><strong>Login Unlock:</strong> Twilight Knife T-Shirt</li>
                <li><strong>Weekly Challenge:</strong> Win in two Adversary modes to get the Pink Skull Emissive Mask and GTA$100,000</li>
            </ul>

            <h3 style="color: var(--accent-pink); font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 10px;">Week 3: October 15 – 21</h3>
            <ul style="color: var(--white-low); font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 25px; padding-left: 20px;">
                <li><strong>Login Unlock:</strong> Butchery and Other Hobbies T-Shirt</li>
                <li><strong>Weekly Challenge:</strong> Win three Races to get the Orange Glow Skeleton Onesie and GTA$100,000</li>
            </ul>

            <h3 style="color: var(--accent-pink); font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 10px;">Week 4: October 22 – 28</h3>
            <ul style="color: var(--white-low); font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 25px; padding-left: 20px;">
                <li><strong>Login Unlock:</strong> White & Red Tech Demon Mask</li>
                <li><strong>Weekly Challenge:</strong> Complete all waves of a Survival to get the Gray Space Interloper Outfit and GTA$150,000</li>
            </ul>

            <h3 style="color: var(--accent-pink); font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 10px;">Week 5: October 29 – November 4</h3>
            <ul style="color: var(--white-low); font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6; padding-left: 20px;">
                <li><strong>Login Unlock:</strong> Brown Vintage Skull Mask and the Halloween Chute Bag</li>
                <li><strong>Weekly Challenge:</strong> Complete 10 waves in a Survival without dying to get the Slasher Clown Outfit and GTA$250,000</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 4rem; text-align: center;">
            <a href="/" style="color: var(--accent-pink); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;">&larr; Back to Home</a>
        </div>
    </main>
</Layout>